<view class="np">
  <view class="page-pad">

    <view class="head">
      <view>
        <view class="t-title">今天</view>
        <view class="t-caption">{{todayLabel}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="streak" wx:if="{{streak > 1}}">连续 {{streak}} 天</view>
    </view>

    <view class="card hero">
      <view class="hero-num">
        <text class="t-display">{{total}}</text>
        <text class="hero-unit">/ {{goal}} ml</text>
      </view>
      <view class="bar">
        <view class="bar-fill" style="width:{{percent}}%"></view>
      </view>
      <view class="t-caption hero-hint">{{hint}}</view>
    </view>

    <button class="btn-primary main-btn" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="onAdd" data-amount="200">
      喝一杯 200ml
    </button>

    <view class="quick">
      <view class="chip" bindtap="onAdd" data-amount="300">+ 300</view>
      <view class="chip" bindtap="onAdd" data-amount="500">+ 500</view>
      <view class="chip" bindtap="onUndo" wx:if="{{total > 0}}">撤销</view>
    </view>

    <view class="section-title row-sb">
      <text class="t-subtitle">今天的记录</text>
      <text class="link" bindtap="goHistory" wx:if="{{recent.length}}">全部记录</text>
    </view>

    <view class="card empty" wx:if="{{recent.length === 0}}">
      <view class="empty-title">还没有记录</view>
      <view class="t-caption">点上面那个按钮，喝第一杯。</view>
    </view>

    <view class="card list" wx:else>
      <view class="row item" wx:for="{{recent}}" wx:key="id">
        <view class="dot"></view>
        <view class="flex-1">
          <view class="t-body">{{item.amount}} ml</view>
          <view class="t-caption">{{item.time}}</view>
        </view>
        <view class="t-caption">{{item.ago}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="tip t-caption">
      记录只保存在这台手机上。卸载小程序或清理缓存会丢，换手机也看不到。
      需要多端同步时，再按阶段 3 接云开发。
    </view>

  </view>
</view>
